><div id="shortcode-259-604" class="ct-shortcode" ><div class='gf_browser_unknown gform_wrapper gform-theme gform-theme--foundation gform-theme--framework gform-theme--orbital' data-form-theme='orbital' data-form-index='0' id='gform_wrapper_1' style='display:none'><div id='gf_1' class='gform_anchor' tabindex='-1'></div><div class='gform_heading'><p class='gform_description'></p><p class='gform_required_legend'>&quot;<span class="gfield_required gfield_required_asterisk">*</span>&quot; geeft vereiste velden aan</p></div><form method='post' enctype='multipart/form-data' target='gform_ajax_frame_1' id='gform_1'  action='/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/CarAudioLimburg-1-min-1024x683.jpg#gf_1' data-formid='1' novalidate><div class='gform-body gform_body'><div id='gform_fields_1' class='gform_fields top_label form_sublabel_below description_below validation_below'><div id="field_1_11" class="gfield gfield--type-licence_plate gfield--input-type-licence_plate gfield--width-half gfield_contains_required field_sublabel_below gfield--no-description field_description_below field_validation_below gfield_visibility_visible"  ><label class='gfield_label gform-field-label' for='input_1_11'>Kenteken<span class="gfield_required"><span class="gfield_required gfield_required_asterisk">*</span></span></label><div class='ginput_container ginput_container_text'><div class='kenteken'><div class='inset'><div class='blue'></div><input class='kenteken-input large' name='input_11' id='input_1_11' type='text' value=''     aria-required="true" aria-invalid="false"   ></div></div></div></div><fieldset id="field_1_16" class="gfield gfield--type-checkbox gfield--type-choice gfield--input-type-checkbox gfield--width-half field_sublabel_below gfield--no-description field_description_below field_validation_below gfield_visibility_visible"  ><html><body><legend class="gfield_label gform-field-label gfield_label_before_complex"><gftt-label class="gftt-label">VIN-Nummer</gftt-label><i id="gftt-1_16" class="gftt-icon gform-theme__no-reset--el" tabindex="0" data-placement="se-alt"></i><div class="gftt-content" id="gftt-1_16-wrap" role="tooltip" aria-hidden="false"><div id="gftt-1_16-content" data-tid="gftt-1_16" aria-hidden="false">Om er 100% zeker van te zijn dat wij over het juiste model praten vragen wij u altijd om een VIN nummer. Dit nummer is niet noodzakelijk tijdens ons eerste contactmoment, maar het helpt ons enorm omdat wij op basis van een kenteken niet voldoende informatie kunnen uitlezen bij het RDW.</div></div></legend><div class="ginput_container ginput_container_checkbox"><div class="gfield_checkbox " id="input_1_16"><div class="gchoice gchoice_1_16_1">
<input class="gfield-choice-input" name="input_16.1" type="checkbox" value="Ik weet mijn VIN-nummer" id="choice_1_16_1" aria-describedby="gftt-1_16-wrap">
